  "ruleText": "Fam 601.01 Scope. These rules shall apply to individuals and business entities seeking initial certification to operate mediator training programs as defined in RSA 328-C:2, III.\n\nSource. #9087, eff 2-16-08; ss by #9675, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12637, eff 10-2-18",
